.TH trellis-release 1 "" trellis "Trellis Manual"
.SH NAME
trellis\-release \- Release orchestration
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtrellis release\fR [\fB\-C\fR|\fB\-\-directory\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Release orchestration
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-C\fR, \fB\-\-directory\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Run as if started in this directory
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
trellis\-release\-pr(1)
Create or update the release PR: version apply on a branch, push, gh pr
